{"id":"402215757","kind":"article","title":"高效的间隔重复记忆系统的最大吸收率是多少？","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4J3EVtt8aQoZg8a5y48AmfYL4GauDjBSzw2s","https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zQQjjGJKWXbiA67R4jhzvz8"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2021-08-21","updated":"2023-01-07","votes":15,"comment_count":4,"minutes":3,"chars":1420,"keywords":["间隔重复","复习负担","错误率","卡片设计","复习间隔"],"summary":"作者用“量子国度”的固定复习间隔构造简化模型，估算每日新卡量与复习时间的关系：在每次答对、每天复习约 10 分钟的假设下，新卡量约为 20 张；若错误率为 20%，则约 13 张，降至 5% 时约 18 张。作者指出减少错误可能使同等复习时间的卡片吞吐量提高约三分之一，同时提醒该固定间隔表未必是优化上限。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/402215757","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"ZKtZ_4Bq\">想象一下，我每天增加 40 张新卡片，我在每次复习中总是答对所有卡片，而且它们的间隔按「量子国度」的固定安排表增长。在一年后，我将会复习：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"x-X0epkm\">5 天前的卡片</li><li data-pid=\"FL4x3yOj\">5+14=19 天前的卡片</li><li data-pid=\"TCh-YBLS\">19+30=49 天前的卡片</li><li data-pid=\"5YHWigwx\">49+60=109 天前的卡片</li><li data-pid=\"XDKPQWPd\">109+120=229 天前的卡片</li></ul><p data-pid=\"ZzOnp_wG\">因此，在这个例子中，我将复习 200 张卡片。如果平均每张花 6 秒钟，那就是每天 20 分钟。如果我们坚持以 10 分钟为限，那我就有 100 张卡片的容量，这意味着每天大约 20 张新卡片。</p><p data-pid=\"wg-p4IXl\">由于指数的关系，两年时间并不会带来太多改变。如果我每天增加 40 张，在下一年再增加约 15k 张后，我每天会复习 240 张（大约 24 分钟）。如果我们想坚持 10 分钟的限制，这将意味着每天 17 张新卡片。在这些假设下，第三年每天又增加了 40 张卡片；第四年则没有增加。</p><p data-pid=\"NwlWAk4U\">当然，这是在假设我每次都能答对的情况下。假设错误率为 10%，那么在一年后，我将复习241 张卡片，而不是 200 张。这还不算太糟。这使我的 10 分钟容量从每天 20 张（一年 7.3k 张）变为每天 16 张（一年 5.8k 张）。如果错误率为 5%，则为每天 18 张（一年约 6.5k 张）。这种差异是巨大的，值得追求，但这并不是决定性的。20% 的错误率产生了每天 13 张的吞吐量（一年约 4.8k 张）。</p><p data-pid=\"xGShZ4KD\">所以换个说法，如果你能把错误率从 20% 降到 5%，你就可以在相同的复习环节内增加 1/3 的卡片。</p><p data-pid=\"94FhA8ET\">不过要注意的是，「量子国度」的安排表可能不是一个很好的优化界限参考：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zS5uKLsoTbkJSadTv2U3Z4G3uEBrFxTLy5E\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">「量子国度」用户在实证五天保留后很少会忘记</a>！另见<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5N3g1Tc9jQMmRnExZxY23cUufNS1g6srNAbU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">优化间隔重复系统的安排表</a>。</p><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"kr\">const</span> <span class=\"nx\">p</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mf\">0.9</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"kr\">const</span> <span class=\"nx\">np</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"nx\">p</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"kr\">const</span> <span class=\"nx\">newCards</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">40</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"kr\">const</span> <span class=\"nx\">ease</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mf\">2.5</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"kr\">const</span> <span class=\"nx\">max</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">365</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"err\">​</span>\n<span class=\"kr\">const</span> <span class=\"nx\">queue</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[{</span><span class=\"nx\">baseDays</span><span class=\"o\">:</span> <span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nx\">factor</span><span class=\"o\">:</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">}];</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">let</span> <span class=\"nx\">total</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">while</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">queue</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">length</span> <span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"kr\">const</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"nx\">baseDays</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nx\">factor</span><span class=\"p\">}</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nx\">queue</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">shift</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n  <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">baseDays</span> <span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"nx\">max</span> <span class=\"o\">||</span> <span class=\"nx\">factor</span> <span class=\"o\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"mf\">0.0001</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">continue</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"nx\">total</span> <span class=\"o\">+=</span> <span class=\"nx\">factor</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"nx\">queue</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">push</span><span class=\"p\">({</span><span class=\"nx\">baseDays</span><span class=\"o\">:</span> <span class=\"nx\">baseDays</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"nx\">ease</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nx\">factor</span><span class=\"o\">:</span> <span class=\"nx\">factor</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"nx\">p</span><span class=\"p\">},</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"nx\">baseDays</span><span class=\"o\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">Math</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nx\">baseDays</span> <span class=\"o\">/</span> <span class=\"nx\">ease</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"nx\">factor</span><span class=\"o\">:</span> <span class=\"nx\">factor</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"nx\">np</span><span class=\"p\">});</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"nx\">console</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">log</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">total</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"nx\">newCards</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div><p data-pid=\"R6XiuxnV\">问：在一生中，使用 2020 年的间隔重复记忆系统，大约可以学到多少张卡片？ <br/>答： <img alt=\"10^6\" class=\"math-eq\" eeimg=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=10%5E6\"/> </p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"SSqcXiut\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"399738674\" href=\"#/post/399738674\">间隔重复系统能力的限制因素是写出足够多的好卡片</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"edneiXGh\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"pXec_YMm\">原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4J3EVtt8aQoZg8a5y48AmfYL4GauDjBSzw2s\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What’s the maximum intake rate of an efficient spaced repetition memory system?</a></blockquote>","rec_chain":[{"id":"401944262","title":"编写间隔重复记忆卡片应避免浅层次的「模式匹配」","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":22,"minutes":3,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"402705173","title":"间隔重复记忆卡片应确保复习者必须从记忆中提取出答案","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":17,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"399738674","title":"间隔重复系统能力的限制因素是写出足够多的好卡片","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":14,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"404257681","title":"间隔重复记忆系统（Spaced repetition memory system）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":88,"minutes":16,"reason":"延伸引用本文"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"412012134","title":"JAnki：写给程序员们的 13 条 Anki 使用经验","author":"Jack Kinsella","votes":148,"minutes":10,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「卡片设计」· Jack Kinsella"}],"rec_answers":[]}